<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Offer Letter</title>

    <style>
        @page {
            size: A4;
            margin: 40px;
        }

        body {
            font-family: "Times New Roman", serif, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #000;
            margin: 0;
        }


        /* ================= PAGE WIDTH ================= */
        .container {
            width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            position: relative;
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 12px 0;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        /* ================= HEADER ================= */
        .header {
            position: relative;
            height: 100px;
        }

        .logo {
            position: absolute;
            margin-top: 10px;
            right: 0;
            top: 0;
            width: 220px;
        }

        .date {
            position: absolute;
            right: 0;
            top: 80px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* ================= ADDRESS ================= */
        .address {
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        /* ================= TITLE ================= */
        .title {
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: underline;
            margin: 30px 0;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        /* ================= SECTION TITLES ================= */
        .section-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 16px;
        }

        /* ================= TERMS ================= */
        ol {
            margin: 5px 0 12px 18px;
            padding: 0;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        /* ================= SIGNATURE ================= */
        .signature {
            margin-top: 50px;
            direction: rtl;
            /* anchors block to right */
        }

        .signature p {
            direction: ltr;
            /* keeps English readable */
            text-align: right;
            width: fit-content;
            /* shrink to content width */
        }

        /* ================= FOOTER ================= */
        .footer {
            margin-top: 50px;
            padding: 12px 0;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        /* REMOVE DEFAULT P MARGINS */
        .footer p {
            margin: 4px 0;
        }

        /* CENTER TITLE PROPERLY */
        .footer strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <!-- HEADER -->
        <div class="header">
            <img src="http://localhost:3000/public/images/logo.png" class="logo" alt="TechRover Logo" />
            <div class="date">Date: <%= joinedAt %>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ADDRESS -->
        <div class="address">
            <p>
                To,<br />
                <%= name %><br />
                    Junagadh-362001
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- TITLE -->
        <div class="title">Offer Letter</div>

        <!-- BODY -->
        <p>Dear <%= firstName %>,</p>

        <p>
            We are pleased an offer to you for a training opportunity at
            <strong>Techrover Solutions Training Center</strong>. We believe that your skills,
            talents, and potential will make a valuable contribution to our organization.
            This offer letter outlines the details of your training program, which is set to
            commence on Dt. <%= joinedAt %>.
        </p>


        <p>
            <span>Training Program Overview:</span>
            During your training (<%= duration %>), you will have the opportunity to gain
                hands-on experience and knowledge in <%= technology %>. Our program is designed
                    to provide you with practical skills and insights to help you develop your career
                    in this field.
        </p>

        <p>Terms and Conditions:</p>

        <ol>
            <li>Attendance: You are expected to attend all training sessions, workshops, and meetings
                as required.</li>
            <li>Confidentiality: You will be required to sign a confidentiality agreement to protect
                the company's proprietary information.</li>
            <li>Evaluation: Your performance during the training program will be regularly reviewed to
                ensure your progress aligns with our training objectives.</li>
            <li>Compensation:
                <%= compensation %>
            </li>
            <li>Employment: This training program does not guarantee employment with Techrover
                Solutions Pvt. Ltd. Any potential employment opportunities will be discussed upon successful completion
                of the training.</li>
        </ol>

        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: -1px;">
            <p style="margin: 0;">
                If you have any questions or need further information, please feel free to contact
                <%= contactPerson %> at Junagadh office.
            </p>
            <p style="margin: 0;">
                Congratulations on your selection for our training program. We believe it will be
                a mutually rewarding experience.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- SIGNATURE -->
        <div class="signature">
            <p>
                Sincerely,<br>
                <strong>
                    <%= signerName %>
                </strong><br />
                <%= signerDesignation %><br />
                    Techrover Solutions<br />
                    B6, Milestone Complex,<br />
                    Zanzarda Road, Junagadh<br />
                    M. <%= signerMobile %>
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- FOOTER -->
        <div class="footer">
            <strong>Techrover Solutions</strong>
            <div
                style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 4px; flex-direction: column; color: gray;">
                <p>406, Milestone Complex, Zanzarda Road, Junagadh, Gujarat-362001</p>
                <p>[P] +91 9825997073 | [E] info@techroversolutions.com | [W] www.techroversolutions.com</p>
                <p>CIN - U72900GJ2020OPC113964</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>